#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:8
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <summary>
#, kde-format
msgid "Creates a box plot of one or more variables."
msgstr "एकस्य वा अधिकस्य चरस्य बक्स प्लॉट् निर्माति ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:12
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <usage>
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Choose numerical data to be plotted. Data can be organized in separate "
"vectors, or in a single outcome variable and one or more grouping variables."
msgstr ""
"प्लॉट् कर्तुं संख्यात्मकदत्तांशं चिनोतु । दत्तांशं पृथक् सदिशेषु, अथवा "
"एकस्मिन् परिणामचररूपेण एकस्मिन् वा अधिकेषु समूहीकरणचरेषु च व्यवस्थितं "
"कर्तुं शक्यते ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:18
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Data format")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the format of your data. This can either be separate numerical "
"vectors, or a single outcome variable split by one or more grouping "
"variables."
msgstr ""
"भवतः दत्तांशस्य प्रारूपं चिनोतु । इदं पृथक् संख्यात्मकसदिशः भवितुम् अर्हति, "
"अथवा एकेन वा अधिकेन समूहीकरणचरेन विभक्तः एकः परिणामचरः भवितुम् अर्हति ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:19
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Variable(s):")
#, kde-format
msgid "For separate variables mode: Select one or more numerical vectors."
msgstr "पृथक् चर मोड् कृते : एकं वा अधिकं वा संख्यात्मकं सदिशं चिनोतु ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:20
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Outcome variable:")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For single(grouped) variable mode: Select one numerical vector as the "
"outcome variable."
msgstr "एकल(समूहीकृत) चरविधानस्य कृते: परिणामचररूपेण एकं संख्यात्मकं सदिशं चिनोतु ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:21
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Group variable(s):")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For single(grouped) variable mode: Select one or more vectors by which to "
"group the outcome variable. Group variables should have the same length as "
"the outcome variable."
msgstr ""
"एकल(समूहीकृत) चरविधानस्य कृते: एकं वा अधिकं वा सदिशं चिनोतु येन परिणामचरं "
"समूहीकृत्य स्थापयितव्यम् । समूहचरानाम् दीर्घता परिणामचरस्य समाना भवेत् ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:22
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Dodged groups")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For single(grouped) variable mode: Dodging boxes within one or more groups "
"can be a nice option when the outcome is split by several group variables. "
"This allows you to select, across how many group variables, boxes should be "
"dodged (\"0\" for no dodging, \"1\" to dodge only the first group variable)."
msgstr ""
"एकल(समूहयुक्त) चरविधानस्य कृते: एकस्य वा अधिकस्य वा समूहस्य अन्तः बक्सान् "
"चकमायितुं एकः सुन्दरः विकल्पः भवितुम् अर्हति यदा परिणामः अनेकैः समूहचरैः "
"विभक्तः भवति । एतेन भवन्तः चयनं कर्तुं शक्नुवन्ति, कियन्तः समूहचराः पारं, "
"पेटीः चकमाः भवेयुः (\"0\" for no dodging, \"1\" to dodge only the first "
"group variable) ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:24
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Box width")
#, kde-format
msgid "Allows to change the width of the boxes, relative to the entire plot."
msgstr "पेटीनां विस्तारं परिवर्तयितुं शक्नोति, सम्पूर्णस्य कथानकस्य सापेक्षम् ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:26
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "orientation")
#, kde-format
msgid "Orientation of the plot: horizontal or vertical."
msgstr "कथानकस्य अभिविन्यासः - क्षैतिजः वा लम्बः वा।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:27
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Draw Notches")
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to draw notches"
msgstr "खांचानि आकर्षितव्यानि वा"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:28
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Draw Outliers")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Whether to draw outliers (if any). Outliers are draw as dots, if this "
"option is checked."
msgstr ""
"बहिःस्थं (यदि सन्ति) आकर्षयितुं वा। बहिर्गताः बिन्दुरूपेण आकृष्यन्ते, यदि "
"एषः विकल्पः परीक्षितः अस्ति ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:29
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Show mean")
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to draw a mark indicating the mean."
msgstr "मध्यमसूचकं चिह्नं आकर्षयितव्यं वा।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:30
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Trim of arithmetic mean")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Trim applies only to the arithmetic mean. By default trim is set to zero. "
"It defines the fraction of observations to be trimmed from each end of a "
"variable before the arithmetic mean is computed."
msgstr ""
"ट्रिम केवलं गणितीयमाध्ये एव प्रवर्तते। पूर्वनिर्धारितरूपेण trim शून्यं इति "
"सेट् भवति । एतत् गणितीयमाध्यस्य गणनापूर्वं चरस्य प्रत्येकं अन्तः "
"च्छेदनीयानां अवलोकनानाम् अंशं परिभाषयति ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:31
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "mean symbol")
#, kde-format
msgid "If the mean is to be indicated: Symbol to use as mark."
msgstr "यदि मध्यमं सूचयितव्यं भवति : चिह्नरूपेण उपयोक्तुं चिह्नम्।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:32
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Type of mean")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Use this option to select a specific type of mean. The arithmetic mean is "
"the default. Others include the geometric mean, the harmonic mean and "
"interquartile mean (IQM)."
msgstr ""
"विशिष्टप्रकारस्य मध्यमस्य चयनार्थं एतस्य विकल्पस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु । "
"गणितीयं माध्यं पूर्वनिर्धारितम् अस्ति । अन्येषु ज्यामितीयमाध्यं, "
"हार्मोनिकमाध्यं, अन्तरचतुर्थांशमाध्यं च (IQM) अन्तर्भवति ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:33
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "show standard deviation")
#, kde-format
msgid "Whether to draw a mark indicating the standard deviation."
msgstr "मानकविचलनसूचकं चिह्नं आकर्षयितव्यं वा।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:34
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "standard deviation symbol (upper)")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the standard deviation is to be indicated: Symbol to use as mark for the "
"upper sd."
msgstr ""
"यदि मानकविचलनं सूचयितव्यं भवति तर्हि: उपरितन sd कृते चिह्नरूपेण उपयोक्तुं "
"प्रतीकम्।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:35
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "standard deviation symbol (lower)")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If the standard deviation is to be indicated: Symbol to use as mark for the "
"lower sd."
msgstr "यदि मानकविचलनं सूचयितव्यं भवति: निम्न sd कृते चिह्नरूपेण उपयोक्तुं प्रतीकम्।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:36
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "size")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Size of mean / sd indicators. This option is only available, if at least "
"one of mean or sd are to be drawn."
msgstr ""
"औसत / sd सूचकानां आकारः । एषः विकल्पः केवलं उपलभ्यते, यदि न्यूनातिन्यूनं "
"mean अथवा sd इत्यस्य एकं आकर्षितव्यम् अस्ति ।"

#: rkward/plugins/plots/box_plot.rkh:37
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Boxplot) <settings> <setting> (refers to element
#. labelled "Color")
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Color of mean / sd indicators. This option is only available, if at least "
"one of mean or sd are to be drawn."
msgstr ""
"मध्यम / sd सूचकानां वर्णः । एषः विकल्पः केवलं उपलभ्यते, यदि न्यूनातिन्यूनं "
"mean अथवा sd इत्यस्य एकं आकर्षितव्यम् अस्ति ।"

